ility and exact submission recheck remain. 81 Firefox tests, 93 native tests, core/compact tests, both typechecks, lint, formatting, Clippy, and packaged macOS build pass. Keep issue open for the packaged desktop Settings interaction and earlier selection-persistence/default-preference decisions; no paid default was added.","files":null},{"type":3,"timestamp":1790456832,"nonce":"1UKGYPN/Ht5WFrq0BWOz+hj0e2g=","metadata":{"github-id":"IC_kwDOUKdEis8AAAABXK4_cw","github-url":"https://github.com/ff6347/giclang/issues/63#issuecomment-5849890675"},"message":"Published f367e52 on feat/opencode-zen-tutor to address Fabian\\s packaged-app report that enabled model switches and selection vanished after restart, leaving a saved sketch session with an unfocusable Agent composer. The native settings allowlist omitted gic.tutor.enabled-model-ids; it now accepts that key and gic.tutor.selected-model, with a real temporary-file reopen test. The browser stores only an explicit selection and restores it after current catalog validation; an unavailable model remains inactive, explicit disabling clears its stored selection, and fresh settings choose no model. The Agent panel displays current provider/model or a distinct actionable disabled reason; input and send button expose the reason accessibly and visually. Core/compact tests, 83 Firefox E2E tests, 98 native tests (plus one ignored opt-in live test), typechecks, lint, Clippy, formatting, and macOS packaging pass. Keep this issue open for Fabian to exercise an actual packaged close/relaunch with saved credentials and for any remaining model-picker defaults decision.","files":null},{"type":3,"timestamp":1790458439,"nonce":"aC9yqj5iqIPTpwNqPaUazJZosdM=","metadata":{"github-id":"IC_kwDOUKdEis8AAAABXLEiQA","github-url":"https://github.com/ff6347/giclang/issues/63#issuecomment-5850079808"},"message":"Tutor model picker and native preference persistence landed on origin/main at 1ba9499. Exact verified provider IDs, searchable per-provider